  "question": {
    "html": "<p>When a horizontal spring is extended by a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>, the force acting on the spring is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span>. The extension of the spring is directly proportional to the force.</p>\n<p>What is the energy stored in the spring?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{F}{2x}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Fx\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Fx}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Fx^{2}}{2}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
